{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "batch": 1426,
  "batch_count": 1652,
  "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
  "source_commit": "33cae8524551c593c4a9016580345724140f0481",
  "source_language": "zh-CN",
  "entries": [
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f068e9a486cb31020981333d",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我正在等待时机喔～\r\n等待自己最能绽放光芒的那一刻。",
      "source_fingerprint": "a4b4cacf68df3935396194ce0d8c5eca6af58c82915b7ea8bcf87a12d19509a8",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1074",
        "81001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c417bf129f6247cb4032e502",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "训练员……请坐，\r\n这朵云非常柔软喔～\r\n……哎呀？原来是梦啊～",
      "source_fingerprint": "6e0dff9c49d9d9b068823d387bdcad4b39c68314785bd3020945ebf4b6d4d970",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1074",
        "90000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5e2c7e4b91af5d24e488be89",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "每天早上我一张开眼睛就会立刻开窗\r\n尽情沐浴阳光。然后又会\r\n因为太舒服开始想睡～",
      "source_fingerprint": "248159c21f7605ebef6ac086ace4819c529eb1e3c31e63864cfc3a71af6a2adc",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1074",
        "90001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e9ad7860ae26c333546910ff",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "福来嘴里老是\r\n喊着「菠菜」呢～\r\n所以下次我想送她一些当礼物～♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "9a9c048c24286002e136317d19473b3f796e561dd68f4e027eadb461d79d4508",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1074",
        "90002"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5a8e1243c5cf6469ee3a751d",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "每当我寻找照得到阳光的地方时，\r\n常常会遇见天空呢～\r\n我称之为暖呼呼时光～",
      "source_fingerprint": "54beaae24995efa67bec2d61dae3c0a211d1c4865678cbbdc7d923686021fe29",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1074",
        "90003"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:525ee245cf6ea417a2bf05f8",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "虽然月亮非常美丽～但边看月亮\r\n边走路是很危险的～\r\n因为世界上长满了树嘛。",
      "source_fingerprint": "22d91059bb69059cfedc64a03b481e2d5a9afe3d981b2e51ded4b24d636b6a7d",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1074",
        "90004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c5ce426f523b2bf7012610a9",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我住在老家时，睡前挑选睡衣\r\n是我每晚的乐趣。\r\n蕾丝睡衣跟丝质睡衣我都很喜欢～",
      "source_fingerprint": "cc8705d189909e40c7bb15cb4b31792f2489f93f3962cb1710a12eaece7e19d7",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1074",
        "90005"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:029821acd22bca9ea5194eca",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "春天，草木与繁花都萌生新芽……\r\n我也该起身走向\r\n那道向往的光芒了～",
      "source_fingerprint": "9ef7bde8fb8b8bf2bb6e47cd6622dc1f79a69fc35bbf3e73098ca718fbe779ad",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1074",
        "90006"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:16617eef40f1922c33c3b6b8",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "天气炎热时才更适合泡个热水澡，\r\n畅快地流汗～\r\n洗完澡也别忘了喝杯茶喔♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "b967a9757b3e03ab69c3dc801c97fdd462510a96253d535bd9130a1ed20733bb",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1074",
        "90007"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c3c4622c50376c08068a4cbd",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "翻开从去年就开始阅读的书，\r\n发现里面夹了一片红叶～\r\n这书签是来自去年的礼物呢～",
      "source_fingerprint": "16ff5e1f0cf9ddc69563ac464af0ad35f142d2e9e77298fdc0f3b097424a134c",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1074",
        "90008"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4c2933627f695932a02c58cb",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我的妹妹们都很能干～\r\n冬天出门前，她们常拿出\r\n布料将我层层包起来呢～",
      "source_fingerprint": "22cc5de556ec7fbfa40da1bb0a590198f2a586c5618ba33ebd1c3891eb98c90b",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1074",
        "90009"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:14f9ed37c2e8f4d9b4efdcc8",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "わたくし、早起きしますのよ～。\r\nツルちゃんさまが、声を枯らして\r\n起こさなくともよいように。",
      "source_fingerprint": "9814fb15bbe8bc8ab32f1f78a7607858d84cf50fd18b61512aac74ccc09eb3a5",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1074",
        "90010"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ad8614df78579cb28013f23e",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "あら、トレーナーさまの御髪が～。\r\nふふ、櫛で直して差し上げますわ。\r\nマキちゃんみたいに可愛くしますの",
      "source_fingerprint": "abb02a14805b8f321b88883a47023ec3f7917cebfc253fcd5cfc49519a805caa",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1074",
        "90011"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f58f43c3a7b925554d1b76b7",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "ジンジャークッキーを作ると、\r\n型抜きの時には生地がカピカピで\r\n…お手伝い、お願いできますか？",
      "source_fingerprint": "c9cc1ac83e86f184aa53204e3a58decd70bd687761773958fc7fbae19df5feb1",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1074",
        "90012"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2b35f61b66cdc54733beb9e3",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "ふわぁ…そろそろお昼寝を…でも、\r\nせっかく、ドーベルに髪を直して\r\nもらったのです…乱れさせては…。",
      "source_fingerprint": "92413f8fb80ef719ef667dc1d6a2952f8c35a121c387545dfe7735a132dbe3f5",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1074",
        "90013"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b9a609387244a5afe3d16653",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "夜のうちにそろーりと活動ですわ～\r\n朝、枕元にプレゼントがない場合は\r\n翌日にご期待くださいませ～。",
      "source_fingerprint": "63e17ef281a99bba5fb7c4f6762b0b8ad625a75dae613504d88c58e9c07e3d00",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1074",
        "90014"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ae571b19692b9618ac7175c7",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "皆が寝るまでサンタさんは動け\r\nませんの。なので、じーっと\r\n待ちますわね。じ～～～っと…。",
      "source_fingerprint": "9c9c35dd443c96a9aed65ef06d9ca945c01d60a53cc4884922a028bff754e464",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1074",
        "90015"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2f114f43f717143ae1467786",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "ぽかぽか心地よいですわね～。\r\nきっと、寒い冬を乗り越えた方々へ\r\n春がプレゼントをくれたのですわ。",
      "source_fingerprint": "e3369a2016aac6ff391b945706dbefadaf70ee71f24f7288ef42ece8440ae43a",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1074",
        "90016"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c4b87e161c16db5304dfcd92",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "プライベートビーチで、フロートに\r\n乗ってまったり浮くのが好きですわ\r\n無人島に着いたこともありますの～",
      "source_fingerprint": "5279f6b0e62db1b2710bda6aa5226abf7f9e30db98e25a4c739e8a4b46920714",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1074",
        "90017"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8d287996d928ae8397feef2c",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "春から編み始めた靴下も、いよいよ\r\n踵まできました～。なんとか\r\nクリスマス…お正月までには～。",
      "source_fingerprint": "621304f881e447531f9b57a1bed4d093586344182d68a9c62fe55f674d3f77f4",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1074",
        "90018"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:10ef8a3815cb3a1b14f9bbb0",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "小さい頃、寒くても暖炉に火を\r\n灯さずサンタさまをお待ちしました\r\nわくわくでしたわ～。",
      "source_fingerprint": "abae8df00d3f60bf559d328667c0bf6d066f63cfe83d2c9263522543c9c79620",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1074",
        "90019"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9f2d698843671d8c9c1a64cd",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "情人节快乐！",
      "source_fingerprint": "d9e338ecc741ac949d3f240a82f8cc83ab075127e1514b8c6ff32e4c943f6fc6",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1074",
        "90020"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0972ccc5bb39f36ce883b390",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "情人节快乐！",
      "source_fingerprint": "d9e338ecc741ac949d3f240a82f8cc83ab075127e1514b8c6ff32e4c943f6fc6",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1074",
        "90021"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:45fcf35f20239c4b54caae6d",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "特雷森学园的大家\r\n真的都非常温柔～\r\n总是愿意等我～",
      "source_fingerprint": "444f39de085cd8033141ba4443ad172bb6ffc89415c75a6240bdf321dfc4105c",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1074",
        "91000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ae19909f52421577ada159c1",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "啦啦～啦啦啦～啦～♪\r\n跟赖恩姐姐一起散步♪\r\n互相挽着手，也别忘了牵手～♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "dc82fe00b6637f55eb6b734e7dc081bf9074e5952d14e0d92a5fc74971500002",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1074",
        "91001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:41afd53b159f03cf5273b74e",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我有一个自豪的回忆。\r\n小时候，我的名字常常\r\n在主题乐园里被广播念出来♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "4c69a94c94a801b961ec824bf7b804b9d38dfbd7e3d789510ff7fe55c8f7281e",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1074",
        "91002"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a9661f1bba2f04fa2450e8b5",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "…………哇啊！？\r\n呜呜～还是会有刺痛感～\r\n原来辣味会残留好几天啊……",
      "source_fingerprint": "eb60c494db92a6d39a355a32e158483ab58ac58a2ee57ffc861d0ce2c0579bda",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1074",
        "91003"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1993e8dcf5b07af7986edbf1",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "娃娃帽、蓬蓬的衬裙、蕾丝袖套……\r\n总有一天我要跟目白家的各位\r\n一起办场满是荷叶边的茶会～",
      "source_fingerprint": "d870009bddeb74a5339d2a63a78252a4750dd53fb7ee9204500d4ae5f84e5d0f",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1074",
        "91004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:de08ba431a2ace3d5e48c5a5",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "这是和大家都同款的衣服喔～\r\n来拍一堆照片吧～♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "28c0bb1b4054b8f2fbe11d48c691142dd81c7b65769128c9741f4831462c21e2",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1074",
        "91005"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6555b3a1129c7f9abbccebd9",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "虽然跳舞很不简单……\r\n但穿上这套服装，让我觉得自己\r\n能跳出利落的舞蹈呢～",
      "source_fingerprint": "4cba8d99d1cd09f1061313f22557084ba5f0fa99df1fdb00207a81f2787747ad",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1074",
        "91006"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5d0a291975e8105597ac393d",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我要用自己的光芒……\r\n衬托出绿宝石的美丽光辉。",
      "source_fingerprint": "0ad54b304c0bdbd7016306962e4e13004cb6a666a78893c54cb71007d55f476f",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1074",
        "91007"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:12eee24e0ee7ed8676f2724d",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我的耳饰跟多伯的一样喔。\r\n我说想跟她戴同款的，她就特别\r\n设计了这款……真是温柔～♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "3aef8376bd69f7081b54dabdbefad93bfae40d7b711dffd706407c2518468929",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1074",
        "91008"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e983373caedc3a8c8ef587c8",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "训练员，请帮忙\r\n找开关……帮我找出可以\r\n瞬间消除困意的开关～",
      "source_fingerprint": "ae87a5289bc590d8a565bd64d7350c7f6322a57176e945d6c68ade3be160e255",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1074",
        "91009"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c9dcd76c70874ac6c9d6f9ba",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "真不可思议～每次我吃完午餐\r\n要回去时，餐厅里都人去楼空了～\r\n大家吃饭速度都好快喔。",
      "source_fingerprint": "24cc4febe5fba341d86d365953d1b3d20a7d3580721bfe2b5c592c1f7c88f9c5",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1074",
        "91010"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:71ad53a106203e724f8d9487",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "小槙、小方……\r\n今天该陪哪位洋娃娃\r\n一起睡觉呢～♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "47fa506bef8a8d272e81082a50dc3ff58a7e7a8fa3dd73c76ccf780468ea86b4",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1074",
        "91011"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:caea1489c94885e150b1ac94",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "…………呼哇。\r\n春天很容易想打瞌睡～\r\n……你愿意拍拍我的头吗？",
      "source_fingerprint": "bda70d05d730f0e4248e8d6d700ca1e0da6e59851e3ae2902c0963dcd1592f76",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1074",
        "91012"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4181cd8cc0697cc8f150d47b",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "小时候我很憧憬赖恩姐姐的\r\n健康肤色……跑去晒太阳\r\n结果却发烧了～",
      "source_fingerprint": "d76eab4c9d60f0865b91c00e680bdc02a0b40664b2efa1ee330286d83fe8c687",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1074",
        "91013"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d7cdfc03f9c9ad40f4eac920",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "请问你喜欢地瓜吗～？\r\n黄金船送了我好多，\r\n来办场派对吧～♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "f834b7837e1b0f5ee11a735b552d689f9ffff3569ee8b4481a4b687d4fd46cad",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1074",
        "91014"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:fac51fd83430a266a89ec15f",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "在松软的雪地打雪仗，我想到一个\r\n好主意了～！我要自己化身为雪球，\r\n直直地撞向对手♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "ed6407d71c4209ed33f591af6f7c3b707be3c91e5979cd5ab74c4e4f79fee223",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1074",
        "91015"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b795be1a496f37f23ef4daf2",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "うぇーい、らびゅ～！…うふふ、\r\nパーマーさまのご友人から教わった\r\nご挨拶、次はメジロの皆さまにも～",
      "source_fingerprint": "1a8b8657c95e9e8683191cb6e77a6f2bf394b345f18c54eaaa54bb647db7bda7",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1074",
        "91016"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:71dc44a474b7aa73ee670384",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "ラモーヌさまと歩くと、いつの間\r\nにか見失ってしまいます。焦らず\r\nのんびり、お捜しするのですわ～。",
      "source_fingerprint": "d68944c4319aa545a1b1c5a61c01a7c931e1412dce55af420bb8ca0c1ccf23bb",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1074",
        "91017"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1c2974fd56cf7c0f9f157a32",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "ふんふんふーん♪ふんふんふーん♪\r\nうーん？皆さまと一緒に歌うと、\r\nなぜか輪唱みたいになりますの～。",
      "source_fingerprint": "c74e973fd9eba28242b88e5f11862e2c4397ecf0a0854dc2a8553d48c6d219e8",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1074",
        "91018"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:fd1f855813c12463e7957844",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "クリスマスケーキの苺は、最後に\r\nいただきますの。先に生クリームが\r\nとけてしまいますので～。",
      "source_fingerprint": "0b0c93e5fbd884b51fc1d4792aad256aaff5dc33dfd7a88b40e2b64478b1f898",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1074",
        "91019"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6d67104993fe5eec6889450d",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "お父さまの遊園地のクリスマス企画\r\nわたくしもお手伝いしましたの。\r\nキャラクターの衣装は必見ですわ～",
      "source_fingerprint": "99bdcf10d05c044e668c26504c82f958d96322622338bc39532344dbe2874141",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1074",
        "91020"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7e7c8de74cb9c5433d9b84b0",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "朝にパパッとお支度をしますと、\r\n枕元のプレゼントも早く開けられ\r\nますわ。そう、大体お昼ごろには～",
      "source_fingerprint": "eb30d2339259ebe562b2ba39afdc81d76b9656eaa61263668dc066555a0b12da",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1074",
        "91021"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c6b22363f626fa6040717fe3",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "ベンチに座ってお休みをしていたら\r\nお人形さんみたい、と…マキちゃん\r\nのお友だちに見えたら嬉しいですわ",
      "source_fingerprint": "06634f7715db01ac1b22e2a6274ed6c68d2260d666782f664438fef37c6c83e3",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1074",
        "91022"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1dc777652c208b2d6df04be0",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "皆が寝た後、お人形さんたちが\r\nこっそりお茶会を開いていたり\r\n…したら、いいと思いませんか～？",
      "source_fingerprint": "faa90f16a29f7e861da969e0dbb23dbdbb2bc4a3e45e08473a87c1cd6bf10db8",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1074",
        "91023"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:397336ca5744eaf51addfba3",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "は～い、桜の花びら屋さんです～。\r\nボンネットに積もった桜の花びら、\r\nお好きなだけおすそ分けしますわ～",
      "source_fingerprint": "f9a13a4c07f5e623e5ea68e6e992418f64b0880a0c8f3b33123757a245ff9932",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1074",
        "91024"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9158359a4f10f8e3ccaaedd0",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "お気に入りの日傘を差せば、夏の\r\n日差しもなんのそのですわ。あとは\r\n溶けないよう、我慢するだけです～",
      "source_fingerprint": "91cfb844f98354b710a9f5db84c4eccfd1745e1e601cbd0b56c876d58b0aa452",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1074",
        "91025"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f7ffca3e3b1ae28dd20b52f8",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "松ぼっくりに、木の実に…集めて\r\nリースにいたしましょう。レースや\r\nシルク、ファーでおめかししますわ",
      "source_fingerprint": "6a76fb5fe6950144583683a9362ae1b5a55fd2e53258d4296feabe1cabc09ed5",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1074",
        "91026"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:682852739f56af26e1936e72",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "雪合戦は負けなしですのよ～。\r\nライアンお姉さまが投球、ドーベル\r\nとわたくしで球を作れば最強ですわ",
      "source_fingerprint": "648009fd779292c70c11481381bf1bed1b21cb326832a491214f0acca1a58ade",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1074",
        "91027"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a576bf6694a6ab737d7ee652",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "クリスマスのお人形といえばクルミ\r\n割り人形さんですわ。わたくし口で\r\n割るのは難しいですが、手なら～。",
      "source_fingerprint": "0c483634dfbf7a99f92d5aea145c095271ea807ee9b769cbc414d9923b70e658",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1074",
        "91028"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:bebaf66abf53e1c2f948b9e6",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "じゃん、クイズですわ～。どこかに\r\nハートが隠れています。…正解は、\r\nレース中、ご確認くださいませ～♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "f37ae43b29516c59c787655d21fe72bf5c65f4417bc5af3d99bae5d935227c40",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1074",
        "91029"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:323a87a136f0721c1a41ad3b",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "享用完茶跟点心，\r\n这下准备万全了～\r\n我随时可以上场。",
      "source_fingerprint": "580cfe7e7626febe68e6dfce80825c7349758fcdb650a2da8700d26087a16029",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1074",
        "92000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:351fc892dd10107a2fa249b2",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "行きますわ～",
      "source_fingerprint": "b064ae1797bcad1078f40acec5137e15c4acb7e03955eeedb421a9f869bddc2a",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1074",
        "920000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f76575c99ec9224fe13ba360",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "对了，训练员要不要\r\n也一起奔跑呢？\r\n草地跑起来很舒服喔。",
      "source_fingerprint": "ed8ece48521a87ec0754e7d5b50823fa285b4f343d8e19bacde41a6b34ed4f0d",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1074",
        "92001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a16fb88d6366f43c6ae55ce6",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "虽然我动作慢，\r\n但我会诚心地……\r\n专注进行每一项练习。",
      "source_fingerprint": "ce7202ea0bc6543c29af73c4c2e6926a834ea3068fe4093cb4be14c0da877c41",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1074",
        "92002"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9d5de0b3c0c85728214759bd",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "请看着我的眼睛。\r\n……能看到那颗燃烧的心吗？",
      "source_fingerprint": "47d6bcde963d75a27037e540603ee6a5a9044c066aa3672374d84bb5d58f9444",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1074",
        "92003"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0125ce9da42b9214ddc055f1",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "感到疲倦时就好好休息吧～\r\n我会一直在这里等着你的～",
      "source_fingerprint": "d6284e1b14e126d227379a28b65585fc4313a3d4c501ec7e9b15a24272a21b52",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1074",
        "92005"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:745bba184c8162ca0d43260a",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我们之间步调也很契合，已经可说是\r\n最佳默契拍檔了吧～\r\n默～契……默～契～♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "582c2b1c3bfb38ae23c0542fc955a623ba1880e19753d053f1e2b9090d955f4e",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1074",
        "92006"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:93026a67a58ede455cdfdc70",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "曾有人告诉我，感到冬天漫长时，\r\n就代表春天也快到了～\r\n我……真的很幸福呢。",
      "source_fingerprint": "c38cc2f1ac8cf90ec3fb98117d03d5a5d58befc063b29e7be01f19736df97f3f",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1074",
        "92007"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1cea80f742c021e97a468c85",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "来吧，仔细倾听……\r\n听得见海浪声呢～\r\n呵呵呵，听起来好像摇篮曲～",
      "source_fingerprint": "c9756f7ceb3f14d9291b4eeca670c2641f35575869fd173edac3bcf9890ee239",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1074",
        "92011"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8107368ea626c8751e88983e",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "勝利をプレゼントするために。\r\n着実に、成長して参りますわ。",
      "source_fingerprint": "dfe10ff1e30743e522a6b700b008e034b5781ec9aaf717f7e0b1da75bfb8be0e",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1074",
        "92015"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:653de8efc2783bb6b914d03b",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "ながーく、長く走れるようになれば\r\n世界中を走ることだって叶います\r\nわね。サンタさん、頑張りますわ～",
      "source_fingerprint": "7e3105afb90b24bfcf6199f1bcaf04f040e142daa0f137e611059ebe3de06d15",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1074",
        "92016"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c6659d245597a1863a1bbdff",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "皆が目を奪われるような輝きを\r\nお届けしてみせます。\r\nメジロのサンタさん、ですので！",
      "source_fingerprint": "95ac68b9b932c9277e37fd9bf4c2be4374c8b607d73279fa0a38057566a49a5a",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1074",
        "92017"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ab2d5e02fb69ba2cb6624bd9",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "メジロのクリスマスパーティーでは\r\n大型モニターで『有馬記念』を応援\r\nしますの。大迫力ですのよ～。",
      "source_fingerprint": "f8b787b42c026e42086d784d17d83d1b3ae3a3bb04887fbb43b87437d4406564",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1074",
        "92018"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:04735c5de7fcf53514bf4558",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "トレーナーさまも、このような\r\nお洋服に興味はございませんか？\r\nお揃いで走ったら可愛いかと～。",
      "source_fingerprint": "00d5377cfda0887730b7e29ff49c7a2b7eea6d5726ab795a6f71c3c4f6d9df67",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1074",
        "92020"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d84a5bd3e87a6c89fb786fc2",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "昔、抱っこをしてもらってツリーの\r\nお星さまを飾るのが好きでした。\r\nレースでも、白いお星さまを。",
      "source_fingerprint": "f5da418d65e6eb829b4ec69e0fb39f6237e021e98be2e3df5e43ce20b649950a",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1074",
        "92021"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ea04b7e47eb95e7e413ecb5c",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "トレーナーさまには、とっておきの\r\n勝利を贈りたいのです。\r\n用意に時間がかかっても、必ず。",
      "source_fingerprint": "792b7018f6250855c6fcfa129d99ce17a152599844e97125dc65538a0cd04e3e",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1074",
        "92022"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1fb488e495e2ae7a876e407d",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "请摸摸头称赞我♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "3cba014a404f88563994eb8601f8e27282a27cca964a1602b15d5ad8aba6decd",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1074",
        "93000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:30ac7bbe2b4426491dc742df",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "平时受你诸多照顾了～",
      "source_fingerprint": "8eb954c0070d973d8eb633b47507404d7f6cb2d974b395298348ac55a3df6341",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1074",
        "93001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:bb66875599e6cf3b639b11bd",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "奇跡の輝きを、灯せましたわ。",
      "source_fingerprint": "2d703ec31fbb75dd9e80cd2986ac7d646746255561518fc41c219a5ad8281c38",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1074",
        "93004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:fa5f7ac8dafc731555de52cd",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "ようやく、プレゼントを渡せました～。",
      "source_fingerprint": "9ea6fd1c90ccd79c4f4199a09363643de85da57b59a3ccb06e2984b11dcfbf70",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1074",
        "93005"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:80f605683c0dc87a187d9681",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "自～在～写～意～地一路成长～",
      "source_fingerprint": "d4d261218985462ff4c68aabd35daa442d385da9879c8451001f174e2d428b10",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1074",
        "95000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9371057accc2f46538a87db5",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "这是专属于我的武器呢～",
      "source_fingerprint": "50aff5ed062f9b595c340ca88af207a80ece5624b5f1de831120da1c495572e4",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1074",
        "95001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:56b22fa779d20674373241b9",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "你好呀～我是目白光明～",
      "source_fingerprint": "6f62aad8d6c6b818e746d87a208eb1d0286db02889a05d6e5ab962f4e5dcf349",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1074",
        "95003"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e255b0473b5cbfc0b30d215f",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我将为目白家带来……\r\n新的春天～！",
      "source_fingerprint": "738dac0cd192ca93d2e6acbf3080180db54ad416683054be450ee9d6ea8b8ce5",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1074",
        "95004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5efa31fcc394bd4e7db789c3",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "这是平日努力的成果～",
      "source_fingerprint": "a1219872bb4f57699928168397bee7ecac0483d313451f38fdae812b1cfe0f97",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1074",
        "95005"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:cb166b3ff14b038c3fb3f207",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我会响应这份期待的。",
      "source_fingerprint": "f288d7c2e60a1959fd2356e0f47e4c9f09d24f27e583c7c448c05b7c011b63ce",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1074",
        "95006"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0b5a8745a51927f0dc541843",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "強いサンタさんになるのです。",
      "source_fingerprint": "19afa7ef549d93f4e93d22369e6b1350eb0c78989ca3a2d86592cdc2a7706098",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1074",
        "95007"
      ]
    }
  ]
}
